# Prime Warsaw

## Goal

The Prime Warsaw landing page: gaming, cinema, karaoke, hookah, and bar. Brand: [@prime_warsaw](https://www.instagram.com/prime_warsaw/) and [@prime_wroclaw](https://www.instagram.com/prime_wroclaw/).

## Stack

`pnpm` · Vite · React 19 · TypeScript · Tailwind 4 · GSAP · `@/*` → `src/*`. No backend, auth, or env files.

## Layout

The page lives in `src/site`: sections, components, hooks, `lib`, `bits`, `styles`, and `assets`. `src/main.tsx` renders it. Full-quality originals for `pnpm assets` live in `assets-src`.

Zones (`src/site/sections/scene-showcase`) is the services list: play zone, sim racing, bar, karaoke, private room, cinema hall, and hookah. The nav label is Zones.

Reviews (`src/site/sections/scene-reviews`) is the Google review strip after the locations cube. The nav label is Reviews.

Questions (`src/site/sections/scene-questions.tsx`) is the Q&A list after reviews. The nav label is Questions.

Addresses in the nav opens `src/site/sections/scene-locations-cube`. Franchise is a mailto in the basement.

## Commands

`pnpm install` · `pnpm dev` · `pnpm lint` · `pnpm typecheck` · `pnpm build`

## Hard constraints

- Mobile-first; English microcopy only
- Motion uses GSAP and the pieces in `src/site/bits`
- `instagram_ref/` is moodboard only — don’t import it unless the still is already in `src/site/assets`
- Keep `pnpm lint` and `pnpm build` green
